[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17102.55, "timestamp": "04:45:02", "text": "YouTube 用户也包括在内。我见过他们所有人。我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17107.75, "timestamp": "04:45:07", "text": "照片。也不能说，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17111.33, "timestamp": "04:45:11", "text": "我不知道他们是否会透露。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17113.628, "timestamp": "04:45:13", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17116.47, "timestamp": "04:45:16", "text": "对我来说，这是公开信息。只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17120.59, "timestamp": "04:45:20", "text": "谷歌一下我的名字。只是在开玩笑。我把它放在那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17123.59, "timestamp": "04:45:23", "text": "粉丝群体。天哪，我觉得当我说的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17125.75, "timestamp": "04:45:25", "text": "直接搜一下我的名字就行了。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17128.868, "timestamp": "04:45:28", "text": "现在感觉自己好自私。对不起。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17132.07, "timestamp": "04:45:32", "text": "意思是，嗯，只是有人会路过而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17134.31, "timestamp": "04:45:34", "text": "从每个呃，就像不同的不同"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17136.708, "timestamp": "04:45:36", "text": "地点。所以，我想确保"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17139.708, "timestamp": "04:45:39", "text": "人们都知道我的工作量，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17142.39, "timestamp": "04:45:42", "text": "一切就绪，闹钟将于5点响起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17145.03, "timestamp": "04:45:45", "text": "凌晨五点。哦，现在是凌晨五点。我的天哪。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17148.51, "timestamp": "04:45:48", "text": "应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17151.83, "timestamp": "04:45:51", "text": "安息。我会说拇指语。我能理解"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17153.91, "timestamp": "04:45:53", "text": "我在钦奈的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17155.15, "timestamp": "04:45:55", "text": "日本人"}]